{
  "__comment": "agentloom Engine dashboard (ticket 7.5, ADR-008). Provisioned as code \u2014 edit this file, not the Grafana UI. Fleet-wide gauges (queue depths, outbox, active workers) are sampled by every worker replica, so panels aggregate them with max(). Metric names are audited against the registered instruments by TestDashboardsAndRulesReferenceRegisteredMetrics.",
  "uid": "agentloom-engine",
  "title": "agentloom / Engine",
  "tags": [
    "agentloom"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
